### =====================================================
### 2FA Disable Method - POST /account/2fa/disable/{method}
### Desactiva UN método 2FA específico (Email o Authenticator);
### requiere confirmar la contraseña
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Desactivar método Email (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable/Email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 2: Desactivar método Authenticator — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable/Authenticator
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 3: Método 2FA inválido en la ruta — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable/sms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 4: Sin token — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable/Email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Test 5: Campo requerido faltante (sin password) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/2fa/disable/Email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
